Phase 6: True Multiprocessing & Self-Hosting Developer Environment

Goal: Turn PDC-OS into a multi-process system capable of developing, scripting, and managing packages on itself.
• 1. True Ring 3 Isolation & Copy-on-Write fork/exec (src/memory.rs, src/scheduler.rs)
	• Enforce strict Ring 0 / Ring 3 privilege separation with per-process page tables (CR3 switching) and kernel-stack-per-thread (TSS.RSP0).
	• Implement fork() (with Copy-on-Write page faults), execve() (loading standalone ELF64 binaries from /disk/bin), and waitpid().
• 2. Pipes, Job Control, & Scripting (src/os/, src/os/services.rs)
